## SECTION: Post-Change Verification (Run after any configuration change)

[MANUAL] POST001 | HIGH   | Log archive completes successfully after config change (check db2diag.log) | VERIFIED
[MANUAL] POST002 | HIGH   | HADR log gap is stable and not growing after config change                | VERIFIED
[MANUAL] POST003 | MEDIUM | db2diag.log reviewed for warnings or errors after changes                 | VERIFIED
[MANUAL] POST004 | MEDIUM | MON_GET_TRANSACTION_LOG shows expected log utilisation                    | VERIFIED
